        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1441">

                <pb facs="1104" n="988" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg988"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/126.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 26, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The First Chief has annulled the Mexico City special tax decree in so far as it
                    affects Americans and other foreigners.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
